    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Dust Remains</i> is a single-player exploration game set on a forgotten stretch of Mars. You were sent to scout for future settlement sites near the ice caps - until your ship crashed. Now, you're on your own\u2026 mostly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talk to your mission supervisor</strong>\u2014a friendly, slightly overwhelmed scientist guiding you via radio.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge equipment</strong> from the wreckage and long-abandoned outposts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a handcrafted Mars</strong> filled with environmental storytelling and remnants of past colonization attempts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your gear</strong> to access new areas and survive in the elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make small choices</strong> that shape the tone of your mission\u2014will you follow orders, or go off-course?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-first, exploration-driven Mars experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mystery unfolding -\u00a0Discover signs of earlier missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your suit -\u00a0Find suit modules and unlock new abilities </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the mission. Or don't.<br>There\u2019s no combat, no time limit, and no right answer.<br>Just the dust, the ruins\u2026 and whatever waits beneath.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Dust Remains</i> is a single-player exploration game set on a forgotten stretch of Mars. You were sent to scout for future settlement sites near the ice caps - until your ship crashed. Now, you're on your own\u2026 mostly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talk to your mission supervisor</strong>\u2014a friendly, slightly overwhelmed scientist guiding you via radio.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge equipment</strong> from the wreckage and long-abandoned outposts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a handcrafted Mars</strong> filled with environmental storytelling and remnants of past colonization attempts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your gear</strong> to access new areas and survive in the elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make small choices</strong> that shape the tone of your mission\u2014will you follow orders, or go off-course?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-first, exploration-driven Mars experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mystery unfolding -\u00a0Discover signs of earlier missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your suit -\u00a0Find suit modules and unlock new abilities </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the mission. Or don't.<br>There\u2019s no combat, no time limit, and no right answer.<br>Just the dust, the ruins\u2026 and whatever waits beneath.</p>",
    "short_description": "You're stranded on mars, with no idea where you are. Noone's around to help you. Explore abandoned settlements and scavenge equipment from them to go even further and uncover what truly happened and why everyone left...",
